# Deterministic local ViolaWWW menubar input smoke test.
#
# Uses XTest-style pointer motion and button events against the menubar, then
# verifies the browser remains visibly rendered.
delay 2500
wait-window "vw|Viola" 3000
delay 3000
target-motion 22 70
delay 30
button 1 press
delay 200
target-motion 22 115
delay 150
screenshot opened
assert-image opened common-visible.json
button 1 release
